    "slug": "cinta-metrica-evel",
    "description": "Hoja de acero Garantiza la precisión y la durabilidad de la cinta Carcasa resistente al impacto Construcción robusta en ABS de máxima durabilidad y resistencia Diseño Ergonómico Se adapta fácilmente a su mano Automática con freno Gran facilidad en el uso Enganche para cinto Para una mayor comodidad",
    "raw_description": "<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><img class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_off et_pb_animation_off_tablet et_pb_animation_off_phone wp-image-682 lazy loaded et-animated alignleft\" src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-steel-889207.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" data-src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-steel-889207.png\" data-srcset=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-steel-889207.png 855w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-steel-889207-480x480.png 480w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 855px, 100vw\" data-was-processed=\"true\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n<p class=\"et_pb_module_header\"><strong>Hoja de acero</strong></p>\n<p>Garantiza la precisión y la durabilidad de la cinta</p>\n<p class=\"et_pb_module_header\"><img class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_off et_pb_animation_off_tablet et_pb_animation_off_phone wp-image-673 lazy loaded et-animated alignleft\" src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-shield-1630365.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" data-src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-shield-1630365.png\" data-srcset=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-shield-1630365.png 1165w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-shield-1630365-980x980.png 980w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-shield-1630365-480x480.png 480w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1165px, 100vw\" data-was-processed=\"true\" /><strong>Carcasa resistente al impacto</strong></p>\n<p>Construcción robusta en ABS de máxima durabilidad y resistencia</p>\n<p><strong><img class=\"alignleft\" src=\"https://t4.ftcdn.net/jpg/15/49/25/43/360_F_1549254357_kBCc9sVZf2hQ7DXzLQTaUeVb1wKieYIh.jpg\" alt=\"Imágenes de Icono De Pulgar Hacia Arriba: descubre bancos de fotos,  ilustraciones, vectores y vídeos de 2,023 | Adobe Stock\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" />Diseño Ergonómico</strong></p>\n<p>Se adapta fácilmente a su mano</p>\n<p><img class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_off et_pb_animation_off_tablet et_pb_animation_off_phone wp-image-675 lazy loaded et-animated alignleft\" src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-automatically-944735.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" data-src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-automatically-944735.png\" data-srcset=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-automatically-944735.png 912w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-automatically-944735-480x480.png 480w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 912px, 100vw\" data-was-processed=\"true\" /><strong>Automática con freno</strong></p>\n<p>Gran facilidad en el uso</p>\n<p><img class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_off et_pb_animation_off_tablet et_pb_animation_off_phone wp-image-676 lazy loaded et-animated alignleft\" src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-chain-link-427750.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" data-src=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-chain-link-427750.png\" data-srcset=\"https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-chain-link-427750.png 1051w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-chain-link-427750-980x979.png 980w, https://evel.com.ar/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/noun-chain-link-427750-480x480.png 480w\" data-sizes=\"auto, (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1051px, 100vw\" data-was-processed=\"true\" /><strong>Enganche para cinto</strong></p>\n<p>Para una mayor comodidad</p>\n</div>"
